WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Lie on your back with knees bent, feet flat on the floor hip-width apart.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Cross the right ankle over the left thigh, just above the knee, flexing the right foot.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Lift the left foot and draw the left thigh toward the chest, threading the right hand through the gap.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Clasp behind the left thigh and gently press the right knee away with the right elbow.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Keep the head and shoulders heavy on the floor. Switch sides when ready.
